Electric Vehicle Extended Warranty
Comprehensive extended warranty for electric, hybrid and PHEV vehicles with flexible payment options
Do you cover electric vehicles and hybrids?
Yes. We provide comprehensive warranty cover for pure electric vehicles (EVs), plug-in hybrids (PHEVs), and self-charging hybrids across the UK. Our plans are tailored to protect the specialist technology that powers modern electric and hybrid cars.
Is the battery cover included?
Yes. Our EV warranty includes protection for the battery management system and electric drivetrain components. While natural battery degradation from age or mileage isn't covered, mechanical or electrical failure of covered components is included.
Can I get a warranty for a used electric car?

Yes, you can. We provide specialist warranty cover for used electric and hybrid vehicles, regardless of their age or mileage. Whether you've bought your EV from a dealer or through a private sale, our plans help protect you from unexpected mechanical and electrical repair costs.
